OL,3,AInside iconic horror game Silent Hill's
OL,4,AScottish makeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs I creep through the heavy fog of
OL,7,FSilent Hill: Townfall, I'm met by an
OL,8,Foddly familiar sight amid the terror -
OL,9,Fa sign for a Sunday roast.
OL,11,FFor the first time, one of gaming's
OL,12,Fbiggest horror franchises - created in
OL,13,FJapan but traditionally set in the US -
OL,14,Fhas come to the UK, set on a fictional
OL,15,FScottish island.
OL,17,FJon McKellan, director at Glaswegian
OL,18,Fdevelopers Screen Burn, told me taking
OL,19,Fon the mega brand was an "absolutely
OL,20,Fterrifying" prospect for the relatively
OL,21,Fsmall team.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
