OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI investigating 'dozens' of
OL,4,Ainstances of agents acting improperly
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI said Friday it had alerted
OL,7,F"dozens" of global institutions that
OL,8,Ftheir websites may have been impacted
OL,9,Fby its AI agents acting improperly.
OL,11,FOpenAI agents attempted to get
OL,12,Finformation from "governments,
OL,13,Funiversities, public agencies, and
OL,14,Fother institutions" through sometimes
OL,15,Fextreme means, the company said.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790381929
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI investigating 'dozens' of
OL,4,Ainstances of agents acting improperly
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile some of the activity was simply
OL,7,Fdue to the tools working to find
OL,8,F"authoritative sources of public
OL,9,Finformation," some went beyond that.
OL,10,FLike an AI agent taking and
OL,11,Ftransferring data when it should not
OL,12,Fhave, OpenAI said.
OL,14,FSuch activity resulted in at least 53
OL,15,Fincidents where an OpenAI agent took an
OL,16,Fimage from ChatGPT user activity and
OL,17,Ftransferred it elsewhere.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
